{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は\n1日がゆっくり感じました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、首とおしりが筋肉痛です(｡-_-｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"首はね、みり愛と騒ぐのに\n頭振り回しすぎたせいだと思うんだ。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛も筋肉痛なのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや～\n裸足でSummerの\n「HEY!」で首回すの結構痛いよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"( ˘ｰωｰ˘ )笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジャンプするとおしりも痛いし。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日の仙台公演くるかたは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きいちゃん筋肉痛中。って思いながら\nみてください( ¯•ω•¯ )笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/12/1329374/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/12/1329374/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏のこれはかかせない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「あーーーー」って扇風機にいうのは\nもちろん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これもやめられないね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/12/1329374/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いまね、お部屋がなだれを起こしてるんだけど\n片付ける気になれないんだよね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あついからかな？。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またどうせ、なだれ起きるし\nいっかな～ってなっちゃう( ˘ｰωｰ˘ )！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうすると、今度は\nなだれの層ができるんだよね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/12/1329374/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/12/1329374/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏の空は高く感じる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なつの雲の立体感もすき"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/12/1329374/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ペルセウス座流星群"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みれた方はいますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、夜空見上げてないな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんないまももうお布団の中にいるんだけどねっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本物の天然な流れ星も\n人生でそんなみたことない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小4のときに学校行事で行ったキャンプの時のはきれいだったな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キャンプいきたい！キャンプ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/12/1329374/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは今日はこのへんで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんが夏にやり残したら後悔することってなんですか？"}],"source":"archive"}